  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "On heating, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>LiNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;gives how many compounds among the following?<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>LiNO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Decomposition of Lithium Nitrate occurs via the following reaction:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>LiNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mover><msub><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>Hence three products <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Li</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
